OL,3,ALindsay Clancy suffering 'command
OL,4,Ahallucination' when she killed
OL,5,Achildren, court hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,9,Fattempted suicide
OL,11,FLindsay Clancy, the Massachusetts mum
OL,12,Fwho has been charged with murdering her
OL,13,Fthree children, was suffering from a
OL,14,F"command hallucination" at the time, a
OL,15,Fforensic psychiatrist has told the jury
OL,16,Fin her trial.
