OL,3,ALindsay Clancy suffering 'command
OL,4,Ahallucination' when she killed
OL,5,Achildren, court hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe defence, which rested its case on
OL,8,FFriday, does not dispute that Clancy
OL,9,Fcarried out the killings but say she
OL,10,Fhas pleaded not guilty to murder
OL,11,Fcharges because she was experiencing
OL,12,Fpostpartum psychosis.
OL,14,FForensic psychiatrist Phillip Resnick,
OL,15,Fthe defence's final witness, testified
OL,16,Fabout the effects of postpartum
OL,17,Fpsychosis.
